WEBVTT

00:00:03.950 --> 00:00:05.110
Stomp!

00:00:05.770 --> 00:00:07.320
Stomp!

00:00:11.450 --> 00:00:13.530
Stomp!

00:00:13.520 --> 00:00:15.020
Selfish!

00:00:15.020 --> 00:00:16.990
Quit stalling and finish them off!

00:00:17.370 --> 00:00:17.990
Self!

00:00:18.450 --> 00:00:21.260
Found a puddle!

00:00:23.670 --> 00:00:26.800
I said finish <i>them</i> off, not my makeup!

00:00:28.650 --> 00:00:31.740
You must respect those around you when playing in puddles!

00:00:33.180 --> 00:00:34.710
Your heart shall go aflutter!

00:00:34.710 --> 00:00:36.380
Ace Shot!

00:00:36.380 --> 00:00:37.780
Bang!

00:00:42.380 --> 00:00:45.310
Love love loooooove!

00:00:48.180 --> 00:00:49.810
I'll remember this!

00:00:55.300 --> 00:00:57.970
Now girls, let us return home.

00:00:57.970 --> 00:00:59.030
Aguri...

00:01:01.910 --> 00:01:02.880
Grandmother?!

00:01:05.580 --> 00:01:07.540
Did you... see that?

00:01:13.980 --> 00:01:13.990
{OP}

00:01:15.820 --> 00:01:20.190
Happy go lucky girls! Precure! Yeah!

00:01:20.190 --> 00:01:22.660
The world is like a merry-go-round

00:01:23.030 --> 00:01:25.530
Love makes it turn, 3, 2, 1

00:01:25.830 --> 00:01:27.580
Every day it sparkles

00:01:27.740 --> 00:01:31.240
Dokidoki Precure

00:01:32.740 --> 00:01:38.150
I wear my new clothes and walk a path I've never walked before

00:01:38.740 --> 00:01:43.820
My heart races and I greet the scenery around me

00:01:43.980 --> 00:01:49.450
The color of the flower on the corner will be my lucky color for the day

00:01:49.990 --> 00:01:54.900
Leave it all to me, because today I'm blessed

00:01:55.760 --> 00:02:00.600
If your friends are in trouble

00:02:00.810 --> 00:02:09.470
isn't it normal to help them?

00:02:09.470 --> 00:02:11.150
Happy lucky Precure

00:02:11.150 --> 00:02:13.550
Only Precure makes my heart pound

00:02:13.780 --> 00:02:16.380
Our happy love will change the world

00:02:16.650 --> 00:02:19.190
What's more than just cute

00:02:19.490 --> 00:02:23.060
is our promise between girls

00:02:23.860 --> 00:02:29.100
I will fight for you and believe in you

00:02:29.140 --> 00:02:35.010
Gather your unparalleled tenderness, yeah, Precure

00:02:42.410 --> 00:02:47.010
To the Person I Love!

00:02:42.410 --> 00:02:47.010
To the Person I Love!

00:02:51.840 --> 00:02:53.730
I've come home...

00:02:57.190 --> 00:02:58.180
Aguri.

00:03:05.970 --> 00:03:07.870
Tomorrow is Career Day,

00:03:08.190 --> 00:03:09.900
so shall we walk to school toge—

00:03:09.080 --> 00:03:10.560
We'll discuss it later.

00:03:17.180 --> 00:03:20.210
I let Grandmother see me...

00:03:20.210 --> 00:03:22.850
How could I have been so careless?

00:03:28.390 --> 00:03:29.190
Aguri.

00:03:29.930 --> 00:03:31.760
Would you like to eat supper?

00:03:31.760 --> 00:03:33.330
No, I'm fine.

00:03:34.160 --> 00:03:37.030
Are you worried over what happened earlier?

00:03:39.640 --> 00:03:42.540
I knew long ago...

00:03:42.540 --> 00:03:45.480
that your destiny would be special.

00:03:46.860 --> 00:03:49.450
I had planned to stay silent for a bit longer,

00:03:49.980 --> 00:03:52.210
but I suppose now is the time.

00:03:56.610 --> 00:04:01.570
We spoke before about how I took you in when you had no relatives.

00:04:01.570 --> 00:04:04.590
Do you remember the day we met?

00:04:05.810 --> 00:04:08.030
I don't remember perfectly.

00:04:08.030 --> 00:04:10.060
I'd be surprised if you could.

00:04:10.430 --> 00:04:12.440
Because at the time...

00:04:13.270 --> 00:04:16.240
you were a newborn baby.

00:04:18.520 --> 00:04:23.320
One year ago, as I was preparing a tea ceremony...

00:04:43.260 --> 00:04:44.540
There, there...

00:04:51.150 --> 00:04:52.810
Selfish!

00:04:56.510 --> 00:04:58.380
Self!

00:05:12.720 --> 00:05:13.980
This child is—

00:05:13.980 --> 00:05:15.270
Cure Ace.

00:05:16.410 --> 00:05:18.970
The legendary warrior of light.

00:05:18.970 --> 00:05:22.350
Please, look after her.

00:05:27.020 --> 00:05:31.150
I did as that mysterious voice asked and looked after of you.

00:05:34.040 --> 00:05:35.250
The girls with you...

00:05:35.940 --> 00:05:37.220
were Mana and her friends, correct?

00:05:39.170 --> 00:05:39.960
Aguri?

00:05:42.290 --> 00:05:43.140
Aguri?

00:06:00.770 --> 00:06:02.510
It's really pouring.

00:06:03.410 --> 00:06:06.340
Now that she's seen us transforming,

00:06:06.340 --> 00:06:09.220
I think we should have a serious talk with Mari.

00:06:09.460 --> 00:06:15.210
But Aguri said she didn't want to involve her in the Precure battles.

00:06:15.210 --> 00:06:19.060
We simply must consider Aguri's feelings first.

00:06:19.060 --> 00:06:21.360
Let's check up on her tomorrow.

00:06:21.360 --> 00:06:22.590
Yeah.

00:06:22.590 --> 00:06:23.690
Well, see y—

00:06:25.750 --> 00:06:26.880
Aguri!

00:06:30.490 --> 00:06:31.340
What happened?

00:06:38.010 --> 00:06:39.050
Rikka!

00:06:39.050 --> 00:06:42.140
Could you invent a machine to turn back time?

00:06:42.140 --> 00:06:43.050
Huh?

00:06:43.830 --> 00:06:46.480
The Yotsuba Conglomerate could fund it!

00:06:46.480 --> 00:06:47.580
Well, uh...

00:06:47.580 --> 00:06:48.360
Oh yeah!

00:06:48.610 --> 00:06:50.570
Ai, use your magic!

00:06:50.570 --> 00:06:52.690
Wait, calm down!

00:06:56.760 --> 00:06:57.930
What?!

00:06:58.410 --> 00:07:00.400
Mari knew about everything?

00:07:00.710 --> 00:07:05.040
Yes, even things that I had not known.

00:07:05.040 --> 00:07:08.640
She said I grew ten years in an instant!

00:07:08.640 --> 00:07:10.790
Uhh...

00:07:10.790 --> 00:07:12.510
That doesn't surprise you?

00:07:12.510 --> 00:07:15.860
I thought it was the most shocking revelation, so I saved it for last...

00:07:15.850 --> 00:07:18.590
Well, uh... you know?

00:07:18.890 --> 00:07:23.560
You always use your emotions to grow older when you transform into a Precure, right?

00:07:26.240 --> 00:07:28.230
Well, I suppose...

00:07:29.020 --> 00:07:33.310
So, you were born in a bamboo field just like Princess Kaguya!

00:07:33.310 --> 00:07:34.710
Princess Kaguya?

00:07:34.710 --> 00:07:36.240
It's the story of a princess...

00:07:36.720 --> 00:07:40.350
who was raised among humans, but returned to her home on the moon.

00:07:41.140 --> 00:07:43.940
'Scuse me, I got a question!

00:07:43.940 --> 00:07:48.000
Aguri, you once told us that you lost to a Selfish.

00:07:48.000 --> 00:07:50.400
Just when did this happen?

00:07:50.400 --> 00:07:53.990
That's what I'd like to know as well!

00:07:53.990 --> 00:07:57.160
My loss to a Selfish happened before I met Grandmother...

00:07:57.560 --> 00:08:01.370
It should be my oldest memory!

00:08:01.370 --> 00:08:03.130
Your oldest memory?

00:08:03.840 --> 00:08:06.600
I... don't have any memories before that.

00:08:08.030 --> 00:08:11.800
I assumed it was due to the trauma of my defeat...

00:08:12.450 --> 00:08:13.970
I'm sorry.

00:08:13.970 --> 00:08:20.810
This story would have revealed the fact that I have no blood relation to Grandmother,

00:08:20.810 --> 00:08:21.950
so I never told you.

00:08:23.890 --> 00:08:25.490
You don't need to apologize.

00:08:26.670 --> 00:08:33.540
It now seems strange that I could have battled a Selfish as a baby before meeting Grandmother.

00:08:33.540 --> 00:08:34.870
A bit...

00:08:34.870 --> 00:08:40.300
But lately, I've been having dreams of Princess Ann battling King Selfish!

00:08:45.720 --> 00:08:51.390
What if the memory of being defeated by a Selfish is not my own?

00:08:53.390 --> 00:08:57.670
I wonder who it was that entrusted you to Mari.

00:08:57.670 --> 00:08:59.550
But the biggest mystery is...

00:09:00.370 --> 00:09:02.790
Who I truly am, correct?

00:09:04.480 --> 00:09:07.290
My head's spinnin'!

00:09:07.290 --> 00:09:09.030
The plot keeps thickening!

00:09:09.810 --> 00:09:10.670
Regardless,

00:09:11.710 --> 00:09:16.460
I can no longer trouble Grandmother!

00:09:17.090 --> 00:09:19.530
We can never be together again.

00:09:20.360 --> 00:09:21.350
Mana?

00:09:21.350 --> 00:09:23.080
Mari's on the phone.

00:09:24.610 --> 00:09:26.780
Hi, we switched the phone.

00:09:28.110 --> 00:09:31.340
Ah, so Aguri really is with you.

00:09:32.300 --> 00:09:33.120
Yes.

00:09:34.140 --> 00:09:34.760
Yes.

00:09:35.040 --> 00:09:38.190
I'm certain she's searching for you.

00:09:40.350 --> 00:09:41.130
Aguri,

00:09:41.780 --> 00:09:43.330
how about you stay over tonight?

00:09:44.790 --> 00:09:45.930
Don't worry.

00:09:46.440 --> 00:09:49.950
I asked Mari about it, and she gave her permission.

00:09:49.950 --> 00:09:51.940
How much did you talk about?

00:09:51.940 --> 00:09:56.410
About that Career Day you've got tomorrow, for starters.

00:09:56.410 --> 00:09:58.410
Mari said she was looking forward to it!

00:09:58.670 --> 00:10:00.150
Is that true?

00:10:00.150 --> 00:10:01.130
Yes.

00:10:01.130 --> 00:10:05.620
We're drawing a picture in front of our parents and then sharing it with them.

00:10:06.120 --> 00:10:10.930
I told her we'd all be sure to drop you off at school.

00:10:11.210 --> 00:10:13.030
We'd "all"?

00:10:13.030 --> 00:10:15.530
Yep! You're all staying over, too!

00:10:16.170 --> 00:10:18.230
We're having a pajama party tonight!

00:10:18.730 --> 00:10:19.840
Why not?

00:10:19.840 --> 00:10:22.210
It's quite a nice idea!

00:10:23.210 --> 00:10:23.940
But...

00:10:24.450 --> 00:10:26.150
You can't have a party...

00:10:26.150 --> 00:10:27.780
Without sweets!

00:10:27.770 --> 00:10:30.030
Sweets!

00:10:31.330 --> 00:10:33.710
Th-That was just a reflex...

00:10:33.710 --> 00:10:35.490
Aw, don't be shy!

00:10:36.250 --> 00:10:40.850
All right girls, this night is gonna rule!

00:10:48.080 --> 00:10:48.570
This one!

00:10:54.400 --> 00:10:55.630
Hey!

00:10:55.630 --> 00:10:58.550
You got <i>any</i> idea what time it is?!

00:11:08.190 --> 00:11:09.570
Can't sleep?

00:11:10.720 --> 00:11:16.430
You said earlier that you didn't want to trouble Mari anymore...

00:11:16.430 --> 00:11:21.900
but I'm sure she doesn't think of you as a trouble at all.

00:11:22.800 --> 00:11:24.600
What makes you say that?

00:11:25.380 --> 00:11:27.950
Because she asked me to do something earlier.

00:11:27.950 --> 00:11:29.810
To take care of you.

00:11:31.670 --> 00:11:36.130
She wouldn't ask that if she didn't care about you.

00:11:37.730 --> 00:11:41.610
People don't turn on the ones they love that quickly. {Not in children's shows, they don't.}

00:11:41.610 --> 00:11:44.850
Emotional bonds are quite strong.

00:11:45.540 --> 00:11:47.790
Cure Ace is Cure Ace,

00:11:47.790 --> 00:11:49.570
and you are who you are.

00:11:49.830 --> 00:11:52.690
You're a dear friend to us.

00:11:52.690 --> 00:11:55.530
I'm sure Mari feels the same way.

00:11:56.980 --> 00:11:58.710
What do you want to do?

00:12:00.010 --> 00:12:03.200
Do you really want to run away from Mari?

00:12:14.370 --> 00:12:17.400
I... want to stay with her.

00:12:18.460 --> 00:12:23.060
Then how about you tell her that when you see her tomorrow?

00:12:24.870 --> 00:12:25.600
I will!

00:12:52.860 --> 00:12:53.690
Don't worry!

00:13:04.630 --> 00:13:07.090
Oh, your grandma came!

00:13:11.470 --> 00:13:12.840
Grandmother...

00:13:18.140 --> 00:13:28.520
The person you love the most

00:13:18.550 --> 00:13:22.810
Today, you're drawing pictures of the person you love the most.

00:13:22.810 --> 00:13:27.260
When you're finished, share it with your mother or father.

00:13:27.260 --> 00:13:28.520
Okay!

00:13:30.880 --> 00:13:32.830
The person I love...

00:13:41.060 --> 00:13:42.630
What's this picture?

