00:13:50.110 --> 00:13:52.580
What'd they scribble this junk for?

00:13:50.110 --> 00:13:52.580
5{*\fax0.375}7{*\fax0.371}t{*\fax0.366}h {*\fax0.356}G{*\fax0.352}r{*\fax0.347}a{*\fax0.342}d{*\fax0.337}u{*\fax0.333}a{*\fax0.328}t{*\fax0.323}i{*\fax0.318}n{*\fax0.314}g {*\fax0.304}C{*\fax0.299}l{*\fax0.295}a{*\fax0.29}s{*\fax0.285}s{*\fax0.276}, {*\fax0.266}F{*\fax0.262}r{*\fax0.257}i{*\fax0.252}e{*\fax0.247}n{*\fax0.243}d{*\fax0.238}s {*\fax0.228}F{*\fax0.224}o{*\fax0.219}r{*\fax0.214}e{*\fax0.209}v{*\fax0.205}er

00:13:56.680 --> 00:13:58.110
It's worthless.

00:13:58.110 --> 00:14:01.380
But they won't lose their love as long as they have their pictures.

00:14:02.220 --> 00:14:04.930
So I'll erase them all from the world!

00:14:04.920 --> 00:14:08.900
The person you love the most

00:14:05.200 --> 00:14:08.900
So yeah, my dad's the person I love the most!

00:14:09.410 --> 00:14:12.100
Your father seems quite elated.

00:14:12.810 --> 00:14:15.570
Now, who wants to share their work next?

00:14:16.200 --> 00:14:18.170
Has anyone else finished their drawings?

00:14:23.460 --> 00:14:26.160
I'm gonna erase it!

00:14:27.580 --> 00:14:31.180
Rub, rub, rub!

00:14:32.750 --> 00:14:35.550
Keep it up! Erase every picture in school!

00:14:35.990 --> 00:14:38.160
I wanna erase more!

00:14:42.990 --> 00:14:44.960
Did a Selfish do that?

00:14:44.960 --> 00:14:46.700
Erase it all!

00:14:47.160 --> 00:14:48.870
Everyone, please come this way.

00:14:49.910 --> 00:14:50.670
Aguri!

00:14:51.130 --> 00:14:54.140
E-rase, e-rase, e-rase, e-rase!

00:14:54.130 --> 00:14:55.340
E-rase!

00:14:55.720 --> 00:14:57.180
E-rase!

00:14:58.740 --> 00:15:00.010
Stop right there!

00:15:01.990 --> 00:15:04.500
I will tolerate no further vandalism!

00:15:05.790 --> 00:15:06.490
Regina!

00:15:07.710 --> 00:15:08.290
Ai!

00:15:08.630 --> 00:15:10.260
Kyupirappa!

00:15:17.070 --> 00:15:19.860
Precure Love Link!

00:15:19.860 --> 00:15:20.680
L-O-V-E!

00:15:20.680 --> 00:15:21.450
L-O-V-E!

00:15:21.450 --> 00:15:22.160
L-O-V-E!

00:15:22.160 --> 00:15:23.240
L-O-V-E!

00:15:24.500 --> 00:15:27.070
Precure Dress Up!

00:15:54.800 --> 00:15:56.180
Brimming with love,

00:15:56.860 --> 00:15:58.290
Cure Heart!

00:16:01.180 --> 00:16:02.550
The light of wisdom,

00:16:03.350 --> 00:16:04.750
Cure Diamond!

00:16:07.240 --> 00:16:09.000
The warmth of the sun,

00:16:09.840 --> 00:16:11.310
Cure Rosetta!

00:16:12.700 --> 00:16:14.050
The blade of courage,

00:16:14.860 --> 00:16:16.180
Cure Sword!

00:16:18.980 --> 00:16:20.880
Love's trump card,

00:16:20.880 --> 00:16:22.240
Cure Ace!

00:16:24.720 --> 00:16:27.420
Listen to the heartbeat of love!

00:16:27.420 --> 00:16:29.140
Dokidoki Precure!

00:16:30.170 --> 00:16:32.480
Oh poor eraser who has lost its love,

00:16:33.100 --> 00:16:34.610
I, Cure Heart,

00:16:34.600 --> 00:16:37.750
will make your heart race once more!

00:16:38.240 --> 00:16:41.370
Could you quit being a pain for <i>once</i>?!

00:16:41.370 --> 00:16:42.610
You're like roaches!

00:16:42.610 --> 00:16:44.250
Stop this already!

00:16:44.250 --> 00:16:44.720
Shaddup!

00:16:45.000 --> 00:16:46.240
Shut uuuuup!

00:16:46.240 --> 00:16:48.120
Erase those Precures!

00:16:48.390 --> 00:16:50.120
Selfish!

00:16:52.890 --> 00:16:54.390
E!

00:16:54.390 --> 00:16:55.890
Rase!

00:16:56.840 --> 00:16:59.130
No running in the halls!

00:17:02.870 --> 00:17:04.340
Eraser Machine Gun!

00:17:07.860 --> 00:17:10.510
Precure Rosetta Reflection!

00:17:19.580 --> 00:17:21.350
Magical Lovely Pad!

00:17:26.660 --> 00:17:29.290
Sword Hurricane!

00:17:33.280 --> 00:17:35.920
Seeeeelf!

00:17:35.920 --> 00:17:37.180
Ish...

00:17:38.090 --> 00:17:39.870
We'll finish him in one strike.

00:17:39.870 --> 00:17:40.910
Not happenin'.

00:17:42.060 --> 00:17:44.570
There's still a lot of pictures left.

00:17:45.360 --> 00:17:45.980
Those are...

00:17:46.490 --> 00:17:49.020
the pictures we all drew for the people we loved!

00:17:49.020 --> 00:17:50.460
People you <i>love</i>?

00:17:50.850 --> 00:17:51.990
Yes!

00:17:51.990 --> 00:17:56.430
We drew those priceless pictures to share them with those we care about!

00:17:58.120 --> 00:17:59.200
You don't say?

00:18:00.200 --> 00:18:01.860
Erase 'em, Selfish!

00:18:02.450 --> 00:18:02.960
Don't do it!

00:18:03.380 --> 00:18:05.240
I said to <i>stop</i> being a pain!

00:18:21.080 --> 00:18:21.780
That's mine!

00:18:21.780 --> 00:18:23.000
Gotcha, chief!

00:18:23.000 --> 00:18:24.590
Eraseraserase...

00:18:35.550 --> 00:18:39.000
C'mon, nobody would want that chicken-scratch.

00:18:39.000 --> 00:18:41.700
You shouldn't have even drawn it in the first place.

00:18:43.910 --> 00:18:45.580
That's not true.

00:18:46.550 --> 00:18:47.610
Grandmother!

00:18:50.050 --> 00:18:54.420
This picture was drawn for me by my dear granddaughter.

00:18:55.240 --> 00:18:56.620
You can erase its colors,

00:18:57.270 --> 00:18:59.660
but the shade of love it holds will never fade!

00:19:00.920 --> 00:19:03.620
I accept your feelings.

00:19:03.620 --> 00:19:05.720
Thank you, Aguri.

00:19:05.720 --> 00:19:06.920
Grandmother...

00:19:14.940 --> 00:19:15.530
Self?

00:19:16.290 --> 00:19:17.520
Could it be?

00:19:17.520 --> 00:19:19.180
This warm light...

00:19:20.670 --> 00:19:22.810
My chest is tingling...

00:19:24.110 --> 00:19:26.710
Selfish, destroy those two!

00:19:26.710 --> 00:19:28.010
Erase!

00:19:29.950 --> 00:19:31.960
You will not succeed.

00:19:31.960 --> 00:19:37.850
Because I, Madoka Aguri, shall not allow you to lay one finger on Grandmother!

00:19:38.830 --> 00:19:43.860
Grandmother, I may well continue to be a burden upon you,

00:19:43.860 --> 00:19:46.120
but I will spare no effort to protect you!

00:19:46.120 --> 00:19:50.040
So let me stay by your side, I beg of you!

00:19:51.960 --> 00:19:54.510
I should ask the same to you!

00:19:56.700 --> 00:19:57.690
Erase!

00:19:59.360 --> 00:20:00.590
Let us go.

00:20:10.210 --> 00:20:11.890
Kyupirappa!

00:20:42.400 --> 00:20:43.320
Erase!

00:20:45.270 --> 00:20:50.370
Precure Royal Lovely Straight Flush!

00:21:02.940 --> 00:21:06.340
Love love loooooove!

00:21:30.090 --> 00:21:34.070
I apologize for running away without a word!

00:21:34.720 --> 00:21:39.550
In light of your picture, I'll forgive you if you weed the garden.

00:21:45.650 --> 00:21:49.000
Is there anything you'd like for dinner?

00:21:51.750 --> 00:21:54.540
I'd like your braised burdock and carrots!

00:21:55.270 --> 00:21:56.570
All right, then.

00:21:57.880 --> 00:21:59.070
Now let's return home.

00:21:59.070 --> 00:22:00.010
Yes!

00:22:04.960 --> 00:22:04.970
{ED}

00:22:07.970 --> 00:22:09.970
Student Council President Speech Contest?

00:22:09.970 --> 00:22:12.580
It's to determine who the best Student Council Pres in Japan is.

00:22:12.810 --> 00:22:15.580
Some past participants have gone on to become Prime Ministers!

00:22:15.580 --> 00:22:17.480
This sounds like it was made for Mana!

00:22:17.480 --> 00:22:18.280
I'm already there!

00:22:18.550 --> 00:22:21.820
It seems this contest is only held on Christmas!

00:22:21.820 --> 00:22:24.890
Huh? But we were all gonna hang out that day!

00:22:26.460 --> 00:22:27.760
<i>Dokidoki Precure</i>:

00:22:27.790 --> 00:22:31.400
A Selfish Trap!

00:22:27.790 --> 00:22:31.400
A Selfish Trap!

00:22:31.800 --> 00:22:33.800
That knot in your heart won't come undone!
